    "detailed_description": "Multi-flatformer Game<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis Genre is Puzzle &amp; Cooperation Game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur game is a game in which two people work together to clear a total of three stages.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStart with a tutorial and test your teamwork!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game can be a game of friendship or betrayal for each other!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso, try various plays in situations where you are at a crossroads of many choices.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are situations where you have to use your brain, including maze content.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShare these situations with a friend you want to play with!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt will be an attractive experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpecial Thanks AOT team members",
